# License

Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Aakash Gupta. The words in each transcript belong to the people who said them.

## What you can do

Build anything on these transcripts. Personal projects, open-source tools, agents, apps, games, and products
you charge money for are all fine.

You can quote passages in what you build and in what you publish about it.

## What we ask

1. Credit the source. Name "The Growth Podcast with Aakash Gupta" and link to https://www.news.aakashg.com
   wherever your project shows or quotes the transcripts.
2. Link quotes back to the moment they were said when you can (the `youtube_url` plus a timestamp).

## What you can't do

1. Re-host or resell the raw transcript files as a dataset of their own. Link to this repo instead.
2. Present a guest as endorsing, advising, or working with your product.
3. Imitate a guest's or the host's voice or likeness (voice clones, deepfakes, chatbots that claim to be them).
   An agent that answers *from* what they said, with citations, is fine.
4. Claim the content as your own.

## No warranty

The transcripts are machine-made from the aired audio and have errors. They are provided as is, without
warranty of any kind. Check a quote against the episode before you publish it.

Questions or a use this doesn't cover: reply to any email from www.news.aakashg.com.
